    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d238">

                <pb facs="0379" n="267" xml:id="pg267"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Minister
                    Calhoun.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-04-18"><hi rendition="#italic">April 18,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Knox informs Mr. Calhoun that the following telegram has to-day been sent to
                    the American embassy at St. Petersburg:<anchor n="1" xml:id="d238-f1"/></p>
                <p>Mr. Knox states that Mr. Calhoun may read this telegram to the minister for
                    foreign affairs for his information. Directs that the telegram be repeated to
                    the American embassy at Tokyo.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
